OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 6 MAY
OL,4,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,5,     GLive from the Chapel of St John's
OL,6,     GCollege, Cambridge, with music by
OL,7,     GMoran, Cecilia McDowall, Howells
OL,8,     Gand Durufle.
OL,9,G1600FComposer of the Week: Bartok
OL,10,     GBartok recovers from romantic
OL,11,     Grejection. Donald Macleod
OL,12,     Gexplores the life of one of
OL,13,     GHungary's greatest composers, who
OL,14,     Gtravelled Europe recording folk
OL,15,     Gsongs.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GKatie introduces live music from
OL,18,     GOliver Wass and Huw Wiggin.
OL,19,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,20,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,21,     Gsoundscape of classical
OL,22,     Gfavourites.
