OL,4,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,5,     GThe New Orleans-raised pianist is
OL,6,     Gback with a groove laden,
OL,7,     Gthoughtful release.
OL,8,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,9,     GEmmanuel Pahud is the soloist in
OL,10,     GMozart's first Flute Concerto,
OL,11,     Gperformed with the Radio France
OL,12,     GPhilharmonic Orchestra and
OL,13,     Gconductor Riccardo Minasi.
OL,14,     GJonathan Swain presents.
